      ],
      "text": "5. Evidence for recommendations",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.55950164794922,
        79.98431396484375,
        344.97149658203125,
        106.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "on the newborn conditions",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.5670166015625,
        248.93988037109375,
        203.75601196289062
      ],
      "text": "5.1\t Vitamin K prophylaxis in newborns",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.19261169433594,
        399.1028137207031,
        220.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "1.\t All newborns should be given 1 mg of vitamin K intramuscularly (IM) after birth",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        220.19261169433594,
        399.13128662109375,
        233.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "(i.e. after the first hour by which the infant should be in skin-to-skin contact with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        233.19261169433594,
        270.58154296875,
        246.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "the mother and breastfeeding should be initiated).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        248.5972900390625,
        277.7628173828125,
        262.5173034667969
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        264.86187744140625,
        399.0827331542969,
        278.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Neonates requiring surgical procedures, those with birth trauma, preterm babies,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        277.86187744140625,
        399.1615295410156,
        291.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "and those exposed in utero to maternal medication known to interfere with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        290.86187744140625,
        399.121337890625,
        304.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "vitamin K are at especially high risk of bleeding and must be given vitamin K",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        303.86187744140625,
        115.60147857666016,
        317.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "(1  mg IM).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.2665100097656,
        277.7628173828125,
        333.1865234375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.20050048828125,
        399.0827941894531,
        354.6905212402344
      ],
      "text": "The panel put large value on the expected benefits of vitamin K prophylaxis which",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.20050048828125,
        399.0329284667969,
        367.6905212402344
      ],
      "text": "clearly outweigh the harms. It also noted that implementation was feasible, and the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.20050048828125,
        184.76292419433594,
        380.6905212402344
      ],
      "text": "cost affordable in most settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        391.7191162109375,
        231.48292541503906,
        403.7091064453125
      ],
      "text": "5.1.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        407.3736877441406,
        399.062744140625,
        420.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "The incidence of classical vitamin K deficiency bleeding in the absence of vitamin K",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        420.3736877441406,
        399.1129150390625,
        433.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "prophylaxis ranges from 10 to 1500 per 100 000 neonates, and that of late Vitamin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        433.3736877441406,
        399.03271484375,
        446.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "K Dependant Bleeding (VKDB) ranges from 5 to 80 per 100 000. There is some",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        446.3736877441406,
        399.0528869628906,
        459.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "evidence to indicate that the incidence of VKDB is at the higher end of the ranges",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        459.3736877441406,
        399.12286376953125,
        472.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "given above in less-developed countries. We found moderate quality evidence to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        472.3736877441406,
        357.6828308105469,
        485.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "show that vitamin K prophylaxis reduces the risk of bleeding in newborns.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        485.3736877441406,
        399.0613708496094,
        498.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "Only two RCTs conducted in the 1960s looked at the impact of vitamin K",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        498.3736877441406,
        399.1028747558594,
        511.86370849609375
      ],
      "text": "supplementation (0.1 to 5 mg IM) on bleeding in neonates [Vietti 1960, Sutherland",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        511.3736572265625,
        399.0927734375,
        524.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "1967]. These studies showed that vitamin K prophylaxis is effective in preventing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        524.3736572265625,
        399.0828552246094,
        537.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "post-circumcision (39% reduction, NNT 21, 95% CI 13 to 50) and non-circumcision",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        537.3736572265625,
        399.1628723144531,
        550.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "bleeding (43% reduction, NNT 80, 95% CI 42 to 714). One of the above studies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        550.3736572265625,
        399.0827941894531,
        563.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "showed that vitamin K prophylaxis resulted in an 81% reduction in moderate or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        563.3736572265625,
        399.0527648925781,
        576.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "severe bleeding (NNT 75, 95% CI 48 to 177) and a 97% reduction in severe bleeding",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        576.3736572265625,
        399.0927734375,
        589.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "(NNT 140, 95% CI 90 to 500). There was no difference in groups given 0.1 mg or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        384.2554016113281,
        589.1536865234375,
        399.055419921875,
        602.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "see",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        589.3736572265625,
        384.6327819824219,
        602.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "5  mg of vitamin K. The quality of this evidence was graded as moderate to low (",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        602.1536865234375,
        134.01290893554688,
        615.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": "GRADE table A7.1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        133.35000610351562,
        602.3736572265625,
        138.86000061035156,
        615.8636474609375
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.39259338378906,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.65460205078125,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "22",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}